flowchart TB
  accTitle: Auto-UV from user request to saved profiles
  accDescr: Top-to-bottom scan lifecycle, tier reuse, bounded search, verification and all exit destinations.
  START([User starts one tier or all three]) --> SETUP["01 · Prepare the GPU<br/>Validate workloads and editable V/F points<br/>Cache interrupted probes; reset stock offsets"]
  SETUP --> RECOVER{"Resume selected<br/>crash checkpoint?"}
  RECOVER -->|No| BASE["02 · Establish the first baseline<br/>Apply power, memory and tail policy<br/>Measure stock; test the loaded flattened curve"]
  RECOVER -->|Yes| RESUME["Restore checkpoint + power policy<br/>Continue at clock selection, step 05"]
  BASE -->|Passing baseline| CHECKPOINT["Save the exact baseline checkpoint"]
  BASE -->|No passing baseline| ABORT([Abort this run])
  CHECKPOINT --> TIER["03 · Prepare the current tier<br/>Efficiency → Balanced → Performance<br/>Reuse baseline only when applied policies match"]
  TIER --> REUSE{"Performance with matching<br/>Balanced descent evidence?"}
  REUSE -->|Yes| CLOCK
  REUSE -->|No| UV["04 · Descend through lower voltage bins<br/>Finite sweep; keep a passing selection<br/>See the voltage-loop detail below"]
  UV --> CLOCK["05 · Apply the tier or custom clock policy<br/>Bounded reclaim, OC or lower-clock steps<br/>No second Efficiency voltage sweep"]
  CLOCK --> SELECT["06 · Select a passing complete curve<br/>Efficiency: highest measured FPS/W<br/>Optional candidate and duration choice"]
  SELECT --> VERIFY["07 · Verify the selected curve intact<br/>Recheck blacklist and monotonic shape<br/>Write a snapshot; run Q2RTX + CUDA"]
  VERIFY -->|Pass| SAVE["08 · Archive the verified profile<br/>Tested points + tier + power + memory + metrics"]
  SAVE --> MORE{"More requested tiers?"}
  MORE -->|Yes| NEXTTIER["Next tier → step 03"]
  MORE -->|No| SAVED{"At least one<br/>profile completed?"}
  SAVED -->|Yes| DONE([Finish with saved profiles and skipped-tier status])
  SAVED -->|No| EMPTY([No new profile<br/>Report last error or all tiers discarded])
  VERIFY -->|Critical failure| ABORT
  VERIFY -->|Ordinary final failure| MODE{"Which run path?"}
  MODE -->|Adaptive tier| SKIP["Skip this tier<br/>Keep earlier completed profiles"]
  SKIP --> MORE
  MODE -->|Normal single tier + final choice| RETRY{"Higher-voltage saved<br/>candidate available and chosen?"}
  MODE -->|Noninteractive / recovery| ABORT
  RETRY -->|Yes| RETRYFINAL["Verify the higher saved voltage → step 07"]
  RETRY -->|No| ABORT
  classDef setup fill:#19334b,stroke:#84c7f5,color:#edf5fa,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef work fill:#18382f,stroke:#80d9ac,color:#edf5fa,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef gate fill:#302c20,stroke:#e9bd76,color:#fff0d8,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef stop fill:#40252a,stroke:#ef9595,color:#fff0f0,stroke-width:1.5px
  class SETUP,BASE,TIER setup
  class START,CHECKPOINT,UV,CLOCK,SELECT,VERIFY,SAVE,DONE,RESUME,NEXTTIER,RETRYFINAL work
  class RECOVER,REUSE,MORE,SAVED,MODE,RETRY,SKIP gate
  class ABORT,EMPTY stop
